sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Family Browser /chat
    participant N as Local Next.js Control Plane
    participant A as Better Auth + SQLite
    participant J as Local Jazz
    participant G as ChatGPT MCP Worker
    participant D as MCPDevice
    participant L as Desktop Commander stdio MCP

    F->>N: GET /chat through same static tunnel origin
    N->>A: Validate browser session / passkey login
    A-->>N: family user subject
    N->>J: Load authorized conversations
    J-->>N: conversation state
    N-->>F: Render chat UI

    F->>N: POST new family message
    N->>J: Insert message + chatJob(pending)
    N-->>F: Accepted + live status stream

    Note over G,N: Operator starts a ChatGPT worker run through the same /mcp origin
    G->>N: OAuth + open_family_worker_session(25m)
    N->>A: Validate worker subject/scope
    N->>J: Insert agentSession lease
    J-->>N: workerSessionId + expiresAt
    loop While ChatGPT keeps taking tool turns and lease remains active
        G->>N: next_chat_job(workerSessionId)
        N->>J: Atomically claim one chatJob
        J-->>N: job + bounded conversation context
        N-->>G: Claimed family turn

        opt Desktop Commander action is needed
            G->>N: call_device_tool(deviceId, tool, args)
            N->>J: Create remoteCall(pending)
            J-->>D: RemoteChannel subscription sees pending call
            D->>N: Claim via control-plane API
            N->>J: pending -> executing
            D->>L: MCP Client -> stdio tool call
            L-->>D: local result
            D->>N: Complete remoteCall
            N->>J: executing -> completed/failed
            J-->>N: durable tool result
            N-->>G: MCP tool result
        end

        G->>N: publish_chat_reply(jobId, response)
        N->>J: Complete chatJob + insert assistant message
        J-->>N: durable chat state
        N-->>F: SSE/poll update
    end
    alt Worker lease expires or ChatGPT stops
        N->>J: Mark agentSession expired/offline
        Note over F,J: Pending chatJobs remain durable; another permitted worker may claim them later
    else Worker continues
        G->>N: renew_family_worker_session()
        N->>J: Extend lease according to policy
    end

    Note over F,L: /chat and /mcp share one public tunnel origin
    Note over J,D: Jazz and device APIs remain local/private on the Mac
    Note over G,J: One long MCP HTTP request is not required
    Note over G,J: ChatGPT background polling duration is not yet a guaranteed platform primitive
    Note over N,J: Each job must carry only the claimed conversation's authorized context
